  "segments": [
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH01",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH01.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "2e5abb40-b111-42e9-b137-fb758abc9dd8",
      "order": 1,
      "text": "股骨头坏死，为什么可能让原本圆滑的关节面塌陷？",
      "taskId": "13843d1f-b8b0-4d89-bed1-d13302bb9a29",
      "assetId": "1ac9b829-cf76-4040-83e4-ee7a0beda82b",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH01.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "db53258b3bbc180b7f56353eab473c820bd8e3b1e02731bd946373d95e069f1e",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/13843d1f-b8b0-4d89-bed1-d13302bb9a29.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH01.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "220e3a0e448a9bae72c8ea067130c6ccefccc79b2215ec7feb3588cd9c31bba1",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/1ac9b829-cf76-4040-83e4-ee7a0beda82b.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 224640,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.68
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH02",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH02.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "1a778f97-e29b-4b5b-a314-7e0eafe8e3b0",
      "order": 2,
      "text": "先看这里：大腿骨顶端的球形部分，就是股骨头。",
      "taskId": "eb4a4443-2792-449c-9c6b-f00bd9ec40ee",
      "assetId": "419d908a-b11d-4f23-9321-6dd7c20c03e5",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH02.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "c3c7ad692956a3a7c0b82e0f0453d8daef455d1bbfa9d7d7fff77e51f6c53ad9",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/eb4a4443-2792-449c-9c6b-f00bd9ec40ee.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH02.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "68efee8a4639d430809248f3ad95c85bbe199d709a52bb44ce232f2ee420963f",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/419d908a-b11d-4f23-9321-6dd7c20c03e5.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 244224,
      "start": 4.68,
      "end": 9.768
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH03",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH03.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "429a80d1-2dac-4fd6-aeb3-c6609aea9c23",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "它表面覆盖软骨，下面是支撑关节面的骨组织。",
      "taskId": "4072b836-991b-4be8-8af1-68bc50eacc04",
      "assetId": "67b38864-3503-4e09-9252-8b16870426c6",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH03.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "5e1840118c759e45b86f9d5654ee1d79813e71bde9cb6c87784eb87cf439a8f8",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/4072b836-991b-4be8-8af1-68bc50eacc04.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH03.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "9e2d60b7aaff4212034b5efbc5dabfbc16acb3688b3ef93ce4e48d6504a3f112",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/67b38864-3503-4e09-9252-8b16870426c6.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 224640,
      "start": 9.768,
      "end": 14.448
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH04",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH04.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "5582739e-611f-4996-8f5e-f25f819c9a1d",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "骨组织也是活的，需要血液不断送来氧气和营养。",
      "taskId": "1880f2a2-043c-4a39-ab82-054c5a574226",
      "assetId": "d585f69a-566b-48a7-a75b-060bf8f2d4b0",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH04.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "e3271c6dfe289fbf9ad31b16b84c9f15df253484d6fc31c89dfe3c58ab7a47c1",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/1880f2a2-043c-4a39-ab82-054c5a574226.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH04.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "05d1698c98af39d47dc7587f61acef4ae8d991f9194b0b53f4e973672b90f3e1",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/d585f69a-566b-48a7-a75b-060bf8f2d4b0.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 213120,
      "start": 14.448,
      "end": 18.888
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH05",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH05.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "1e09a362-e6eb-4cf0-90bb-ce7f1d3b81c4",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "当局部血液供应受损，这里的骨组织就可能发生坏死。",
      "taskId": "6658739d-4778-4f59-8ae6-a764ea8e36af",
      "assetId": "376e336a-a71f-4d22-bb9f-ebce0a653f62",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH05.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "fbba37fe233321b69d6cd6d3bf040186f9989c6eff96660829b75ec49579a3fb",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/6658739d-4778-4f59-8ae6-a764ea8e36af.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH05.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "7c0fde7cd1af5dbc6a1cce8d022d1dbaeba36cc625f7cad32fc6d834910dd7cc",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/376e336a-a71f-4d22-bb9f-ebce0a653f62.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 232704,
      "start": 18.888,
      "end": 23.736
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH06",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH06.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "09985f81-72ee-43c5-bc56-0a48e78d7b0d",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "但细胞死亡，不等于原有的骨架马上消失。",
      "taskId": "2ec5815c-42ad-4c0c-ba00-1ec664062a5f",
      "assetId": "dcf55c4c-e6ae-4d23-820a-c1aa98166fb3",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH06.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "7a161bce7244f0a5c6e1f9460e490bd41eeeb2439fc427a456e82e9ab88bb3c2",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/2ec5815c-42ad-4c0c-ba00-1ec664062a5f.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH06.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "262b32553d42cd19f45121a3a5a991abe2315db5ffbefee634908bf92580a39e",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/dcf55c4c-e6ae-4d23-820a-c1aa98166fb3.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 185472,
      "start": 23.736,
      "end": 27.6
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH07",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH07.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "5b18fddd-76d9-44f5-90e9-8663ff71e12c",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "此时，股骨头外形仍可能保持完整。",
      "taskId": "83cc7d16-a2a0-4f43-a179-bbb884adcdc8",
      "assetId": "dc7832d4-3b8e-49d0-ac71-6b1b9aa108c3",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH07.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "ce878058ab7d6218265bd61bf243622a0fdb6ef212f7320c002e58c71788e5a6",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/83cc7d16-a2a0-4f43-a179-bbb884adcdc8.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH07.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "2e0bc857eee554c11f1244a5b4ecf0b27ac62bd45de945b34a00e09e0551290e",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/dc7832d4-3b8e-49d0-ac71-6b1b9aa108c3.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 185472,
      "start": 27.6,
      "end": 31.464
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH08",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH08.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "f27fcec6-b3b4-4048-9dd4-79eaa9cf6930",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "身体也会尝试修复受损区域。",
      "taskId": "e59b50fd-4f54-4057-8612-611f4435ad4f",
      "assetId": "66540b5d-b313-493e-85f9-fb1b02e57494",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH08.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "6beac68c48d554178d66ee517d2115ffbc68fe895db5bbd91ae8417018950f52",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/e59b50fd-4f54-4057-8612-611f4435ad4f.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH08.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "31ef4b30bc1947f8fb96d8f47ee54ad10a1f38136c2fd8391c8429914774979c",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/66540b5d-b313-493e-85f9-fb1b02e57494.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 135936,
      "start": 31.464,
      "end": 34.296
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH09",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH09.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "9556199e-a633-4052-bb15-63f46f5a409c",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "修复涉及旧骨吸收和新骨形成，但不一定能恢复足够的支撑。",
      "taskId": "aae43103-e516-42a1-8e8f-75cd0e5fd4a5",
      "assetId": "f0998caf-6d8b-4e80-88c7-f652e933d613",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH09.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "28dd2b7bc33c56388501474cea7b5c57a461c30f3ef936b66042a87a853c4e99",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/aae43103-e516-42a1-8e8f-75cd0e5fd4a5.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH09.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "b8f763316ef8de6d8563ab1db173a41b3487e85bf7c657fbc626facdda99c5ab",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/f0998caf-6d8b-4e80-88c7-f652e933d613.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 281088,
      "start": 34.296,
      "end": 40.152
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH10",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH10-slow.json",
      "reviewVersion": "fh10-slow-v3",
      "segmentId": "d9b6c5b5-abe9-4a98-bd84-c7667eb44dce",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "如果局部结构继续受损，承重时就可能出现细小骨折。",
      "taskId": "13c0ba78-4e76-4c19-9a9b-b052dcfd9664",
      "assetId": "4f2c6388-eba2-4823-a813-be23f4d53808",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH10-slow.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "4f424a8dc949bee1250604d8c05749580967e90f00c842edbb60ed00f74ec951",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/13c0ba78-4e76-4c19-9a9b-b052dcfd9664.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH10-slow.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "ed17ff95a5964791e719d15aec3f28a774508084b2ad88545529445d1a6c5f69",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/4f2c6388-eba2-4823-a813-be23f4d53808.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 232704,
      "start": 40.152,
      "end": 45.0
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH11–FH12",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH11-FH12.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "e509e18d-edab-4700-8695-3df351c66a4e",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "损伤进一步发展，关节面下方的骨组织可能失去支撑，表面发生局部下陷。",
      "taskId": "420d818b-a99c-4613-b9c3-fd601062ed33",
      "assetId": "55edf651-f4f1-45c1-9ae4-d7fde232b035",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH11-FH12.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "a3dd8a7b8a8f307d381d707f9b19d15fa39a1a65f5541fe79672b4dfb94465ca",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/420d818b-a99c-4613-b9c3-fd601062ed33.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH11-FH12.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "3d8f7aa2944748b7730e3352d6c716dbb5b662d3d542e3fe908f1b4b59153b0b",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/55edf651-f4f1-45c1-9ae4-d7fde232b035.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 327168,
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 51.816
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH13",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH13.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "e4416bfe-3823-49c7-a89d-99355c437679",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "不过，并不是每个坏死的股骨头都会塌陷。",
      "taskId": "65e9f937-f960-4d3a-867d-02e904ab2951",
      "assetId": "95c51665-f6cd-495b-940e-342af64e6323",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH13.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "4e2f2a024ea4561394c11597e0855bc3fa0b05d53dd9c884eef38071fa75d595",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/65e9f937-f960-4d3a-867d-02e904ab2951.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH13.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "3d41cfc2327ac62a2c70f1b9b4d27d18f3da3477f2fe29454e52b3c5cf422b8b",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/95c51665-f6cd-495b-940e-342af64e6323.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 194688,
      "start": 51.816,
      "end": 55.872
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH14",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH14.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "95695858-1813-4d56-bd80-b310d5bd84b7",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "受损范围、位置等因素，都会影响进展。",
      "taskId": "aef6e056-25fa-4a28-83a9-f1709316f654",
      "assetId": "e620f5f9-613a-43c5-b236-7b93c32f6618",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH14.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "29d4ffa908f8baba2f5b0b426ae5b560ff7c45fc49f996dfe919eb098d906328",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/aef6e056-25fa-4a28-83a9-f1709316f654.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH14.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "4d0ee82922cc4ef943a9adeb9876294e4fa3fb8f2c2fb128fdd2d1d9d5730dc5",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/e620f5f9-613a-43c5-b236-7b93c32f6618.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 185472,
      "start": 55.872,
      "end": 59.736
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH15",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH15.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "d8c30c3e-1358-4777-8581-9592360642b9",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "所以，坏死说的是骨组织死亡。",
      "taskId": "15ba7b87-612d-419a-b728-3571be936a7f",
      "assetId": "a4675afd-d978-4e9e-b58f-69bd81b2a826",
      "assetStart": 0,
      "audioPath": "full-inputs/audio/FH15.mp3",
      "audioSha256": "8ec608958f54d283011849141c0b6387cffceaab902047ff95b72af344a453d2",
      "originalAudioPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/15ba7b87-612d-419a-b728-3571be936a7f.mp3",
      "assemblyPath": "full-inputs/assets/FH15.source.mp4",
      "assemblySha256": "bc80ba5a15b5baa1296351fabd100454b641512c9147ea2935172596ba57249d",
      "originalAssemblyPath": "/home/forclaw/code/ClapGrid/clapgrid/media/a4675afd-d978-4e9e-b58f-69bd81b2a826.source",
      "decodedAudioSamples48k": 173952,
      "start": 59.736,
      "end": 63.36
    },
    {
      "logicalCard": "FH16",
      "cardPath": "cards/FH16.json",
      "reviewVersion": null,
      "segmentId": "665a5773-57f1-4bfd-918a-680dd3eb3d41",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "塌陷说的是支撑结构失效后，外形发生了改变。",
      "taskId": "8ab61b38-3aa1-45ea-aae1-6b8d2911486d",
      "assetId": "d21020b8-4299-4362-b97f-8cece1c460d8",
